11	/**
12	 * Business Email — mailbox hosting per registered domain.
13	 *
14	 * An `EmailPlan` is a pricing tier (N mailboxes, GB/mailbox, price, term). A
15	 * customer subscribes one of their own domains to a tier (`EmailSubscription`),
16	 * which debits the wallet, then manages individual `Mailbox` rows under it.
17	 *
18	 * IMPORTANT — this is the product + ordering scaffold. Actual mail delivery is a
19	 * pluggable mail-provider integration that is NOT wired up yet. We therefore do
20	 * NOT provision real mailboxes or send anything: creating a Mailbox row records
21	 * intent; the address is marked "provisioning" until the provider integration
22	 * lands. Nothing here fakes delivery.
23	 *
24	 * This module owns:
25	 *   - orderEmailHosting (customer subscribe)
26	 *   - addMailbox / removeMailbox (customer mailbox management)
27	 *   - adminSaveEmailPlan / adminToggleEmailPlan / adminDeleteEmailPlan (CRUD)
