3	// Server actions for connecting/disconnecting a customer's own Anthropic API
4	// key (BYOK). Only async functions are exported (Next.js "use server" rule).
5	// The stored key is AES-256-GCM encrypted at rest and NEVER returned to the
6	// client — callers can only learn whether a key is connected, not its value.
