27	 * Layer 1 (cheap, in-process): a short-window duplicate-submit guard keyed on
28	 * user+domain. Catches the double-click / impatient-retry case immediately and
29	 * keeps two concurrent requests from both reaching the registrar. Best-effort
30	 * only — it does not survive a restart or span multiple app instances.
